  "description": "AERA GOES FULLY. Experience exceptional comfort with a design focused on optimal ergonomics. Every detail has been carefully developed to deliver an outstanding riding experience. Whether on extended tours or short rides, the AERA FS comfort concept ensures that every kilometer feels effortless and relaxed. The new FS models offer 100 mm of rear travel, while the smooth suspension and well-balanced riding position provide outstanding comfort from the very first ride. Powerful support is provided by the Bosch Performance Line CX (BDU384Y), delivering up to 100 Nm of torque, 750 watts of maximum motor power, and up to 600% support. Combined with the 800 Wh PowerTube, it provides the power and range needed for both everyday riding and extended tours. When it comes to battery integration, KTM continues to rely on its proven POWER TUBE TOP LOADER (PTTL) system. The battery can be co nveniently removed upwards from the downtube and just as easily reinserted.",
